@startuml
title print PATH — algorithm
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read command and validate arguments;
if (Command syntax valid?) then (yes)
:Parse event root or local name and path segments;
:Traverse object keys and nonnegative array indexes in current values;
if (Value available?) then (yes)
:Display PATH and JSON value, null is a valid value;
else (no)
:Report unavailable value or invalid-path command error;
endif
else (no)
:Display command error, keep current state;
endif
stop
@enduml
